1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
We are FinVeritas. This is BorderProof AI,
an evidence-first tuition-payment assistant.
All data is synthetic. No real money moves.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Invoices, beneficiaries, quotes and approvals
can contradict or change.
An AI answer is not financial authorization.

3
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:15,000
We extract structured details from a synthetic invoice.
Extraction is not bank verification.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:45,000
The local investigation compares evidence and
synthetic beneficiary records.
Quotes are not market-executable prices.

5
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:15,000
The student grants transaction-specific consent.
The simulator checks the evidence again
and records an internal test receipt.

6
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:45,000
BPCE checks dependency changes and stale approval.
Reviewer and auditor views support oversight.

7
00:02:45,000 --> 00:03:10,000
The planner gives read-only next steps.
Evidence export is self-hashed, not bank-signed.
Local support cannot initiate refunds.

8
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:45,000
The 300-case synthetic benchmark includes 60 holdout cases.
Our BPCE rule proxy accepted 5 of 48 unsafe cases
and rejected 3 of 12 legitimate cases.
These are not real LLM-agent results.

9
00:03:45,000 --> 00:04:15,000
This is a measurable internal finance simulator,
not a live payment product.
Thank you from FinVeritas.
